--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Google ML Kit — com.google.mlkit:text-recognition
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
ML Kit is NOT open source. It is a proprietary Google SDK distributed under the
ML Kit Terms of Service, which impose obligations on the app that ships it.

The practical consequence: this repository's source is Apache 2.0, but a build of
it is not a wholly open-source artefact, and anyone forking it inherits Google's
terms rather than only ours. Used by the on-device receipt scanner (issue 3.8).

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Google Tink — com.google.crypto.tink:tink-android
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Apache License 2.0. Named separately because SEC-003 makes it the only sanctioned
cryptography in this project: no hand-rolled crypto, review-blocking.

