Everything else
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AndroidX (Compose, Room, DataStore, Glance, WorkManager, Navigation, Lifecycle,
Paging, Biometric, Activity, Core, SQLite), Kotlin and kotlinx, Dagger/Hilt, KSP,
Protobuf, Retrofit, OkHttp, and the build and test toolchain (AGP, detekt, ktlint,
Truth, MockK, Robolectric, Turbine, JUnit) — see each project for its own terms.

DO NOT treat the list above as a licence audit. It is a hand-written summary and
hand-written attribution lists go stale the first time someone adds a dependency.
Before you ship publicly, generate the real one mechanically — the
com.google.android.gms.oss-licenses-plugin produces an in-app licences screen
from the actual resolved dependency graph — and keep the generated artefact, not
this file, as the authoritative record.

